  "details": "The current keyboard (in old and new UI) feels really in-responsive.\nIt feels (on index) that I almost have to release completely of my trigger to type a single letter.\nLike OVR Toolkit & XSOverlay typing feels so much nicer.\n\nI type with both of my controllers, not just with a single one.",
